                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_140701"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any inhibitor of secreted frizzled-related protein 1 (SFRP1). The level of SFRP1 affects osteoblast apoptosis and proliferation, so SFRP1 inhibitors have the potential to be used for the treatment of osteoporosis or other bone related disorders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
