            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A drug that has principally analgesic, antipyretic and anti-inflammatory actions. Non-narcotic analgesics do not bind to opioid receptors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
