        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An agent that modulates the physiologic angiogenesis process. This is accomplished by endogenous angiogenic proteins and a variety of other chemicals and pharmaceutical agents.</obo:IAO_0000115>
