        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A dopaminergic agent that blocks the transport of dopamine into axon terminals or into storage vesicles within terminals. Most of the adrenergic uptake inhibitors also inhibit dopamine uptake.</obo:IAO_0000115>
