            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any intra-glandular substance that acts as a precursor of a hormone, usually having minimal hormonal effect itself. Prohormones generally help in amplifying the effect of existing hormones.</obo:IAO_0000115>
